{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港股低開後最多跌140點，恒生指數低見23385點，臨近中午收復失地，中午報23529點，升3點，半日主板成交額逾877億元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技指數報3828點，跌1%。ATMXJ都跌，京東集團、阿里巴巴跌近2%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n汽車、AI大模型股份跌幅較大，小鵬、蔚來、理想、MINIMAX、智譜跌逾3%至約4%。內房股亦偏軟。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n晶片及醫藥股上升，百濟神州、藥明生物、藥明康德升近5%或以上，是表現最好3隻藍籌股；中芯升逾2%。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T04:44:56.591698+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T04:14:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:38:57.288058+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T04:38:41.272885+00:00","content_hash":"38013ab9db98f435f2aafa35b394973986ab8676c0f8b320bf3cf3705e88d526","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}